# SkillHub · Integrated AI Workflow

Follow user skill **`integrated-ai-workflow`** for routing (Small / Medium / Large). This rule adds **repo-specific** paths and verify gates only.

## Document roles

| Layer | Location | Purpose |
|-------|----------|---------|
| Program / sprint | `RECORD.md`, `.project_memory/active/SPRINT_*.md` | Phase goals, sprint checkboxes — **not** feature implementation tasks |
| Published specs | `docs/specs/`, `docs/guides/` | Normative protocols |
| Active feature work | `openspec/changes/<change>/` | proposal, specs, design, **tasks.md** (implementation truth) |
| Legacy superpowers docs | `docs/superpowers/plans/`, `docs/superpowers/specs/` | Reference only; new work → OpenSpec changes |

## Session start (substantive work)

1. Read `RECORD.md` + active `.project_memory/active/SPRINT_*.md` (tiered-memory alignment).
2. Classify change size per `integrated-ai-workflow` — **do not** default to full large pipeline.
3. Do not copy sprint checklists into OpenSpec `tasks.md`.

## SkillHub verify gates (in addition to skill defaults)

- **Tests:** `verification-before-completion` → `pytest` (and eval CLI when touching eval paths).
- **Doc encoding:** after RECORD or `.project_memory` edits → `pytest tests/test_doc_encoding.py -q` (see `doc-encoding-utf8` rule).
- **UI / chat-shell changes:** after pytest green, before archive → run **one fixed Demo script** (vertical slice, not a single API test). Chat-First: stock-radar flow (补题→澄清→正式评→专家裁定).

## UI layer (SkillHub demo)

- Visual-only target: `skillhub_eval/adapters/ui/static/index.html` (+ `trace.html`).
- Backend `skillhub_eval/adapters/ui/` — **do not change** for UI polish.
- Trigger phrases: 「优化界面」「改 UI」「视觉风格」「排版」「hover 动效」→ `frontend-design`, not full OpenSpec pipeline.

## Project conventions (inject into OpenSpec artifacts)

- Python package: `skillhub_eval/`; tests under `tests/`.
- Normative refs: `docs/specs/Skill元数据定义与编写规范.md`, `docs/specs/评估指标与准入标准.md`.
- API/schema names must match existing specs.
- Secrets: `.env` only.

## OpenSpec CLI

`openspec/config.yaml`. Status: `openspec status --change "<name>" --json`.

When user says「开始实现」: confirm active change, read `tasks.md`, confirm size class still fits Medium/Large route.

## Conflict prevention (SkillHub)

- OpenSpec owns *what*; Superpowers owns *how*.
- grill-me: optional plan review — not a substitute for human review after propose.
- harness-retrospective → `~/.agent_learning/` only; never auto-write RECORD or `.project_memory/`.
